******************** IMPORTANT ***********************
To make this policy package active, execute:

semodule -i mariadb_socket.pp

Or if want to recompile first make changes to mariadb_socket.te and run:
checkmodule -M -m -o mariadb_socket.mod mariadb_socket.te
semodule_package -o mariadb_socket.pp -m mariadb_socket.mod

# if datadir is nfs mounted
sudo setsebool -P mysql_connect_any 1

# to allow system daemons to communicate with, manage, or run as part of a High-Availability (HA) cluster infrastructure
#sudo setsebool -P daemons_enable_cluster_mode 1
